  "description": "<p>Gusts of air carry you over land.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, you gain a <strong>Fly</strong> speed of <strong>5</strong>. If you already have a <strong>Fly</strong> speed, it increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Fly</strong> speed gained by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p>",
